                    "#*If you're planning on having a salt water pool, you'll [[Add Salt to a Pool|add the salt]] (along with the correct proportions of other chemicals) after the pool has been filled.<ref>http://pooluniversity.org/how-much-salt-to-add-to-pool/</ref>"
