            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#Run the electricity. Get an electrician to run power to your pool if it is needed for lights or the filtration system. Most importantly, Three things are very important while constructing a pool to save money. First is to purchase a pool cover to prevent evaporation, invest in buying a variable speed pump to increase efficiency 60-70% more that makes pool quieter to run. But time should be reduced to pump for which it is operating. Add to that, quality of water can be maintained by 3-4 hours per day for chlorinated pools. This is another time where it is important to hire a professional, as you can imagine what bad wiring plus water leads to.<br><br>{{whvid|Build a Swimming Pool Step 7.360p.mp4|Build a Swimming Pool Step 7-preview.jpg|Build a Swimming Pool Step 7 Version 3.jpg|gif=Build a Swimming Pool Step 7.360p.gif|giffirst=Build a Swimming Pool Step 7.360p.first.gif}}",
                    "*http://www.fixzit.com.au/news/tips_advice/summer-avers-how-to-save-with-your-pool-and-ac.php Contributing source - Summer $avers – How to Save with Your Pool and AC"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#Run the electricity. Get an electrician to run power to your pool if it is needed for lights or the filtration system. This is another time where it is important to hire a professional, as you can imagine what bad wiring plus water leads to.<br><br>{{whvid|Build a Swimming Pool Step 7.360p.mp4|Build a Swimming Pool Step 7-preview.jpg|Build a Swimming Pool Step 7 Version 3.jpg|gif=Build a Swimming Pool Step 7.360p.gif|giffirst=Build a Swimming Pool Step 7.360p.first.gif}}"
